,"canEdit":true,"expend":true,"reward":false,"firstImg":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/18119eefa672b413fd1a8051.jpeg","rawTitle":"好消息！减半征收部分乘用车车辆购置税，最高可减1.5万元！","tagStr":"","longTextForIOS":false,"topic_pic_thumbnail_small":null,"topic_pic_thumbnail":null,"topic_pic_headOrPad":null,"tagsForWeb":";","reply_count":0,"meta_keywords":"{\"stockCorrelation\":\"SZ159735\",\"stockList\":\"SZ159735_13\"}","paid_mention":null,"reward_count":0,"reward_amount":0,"reward_user_count":0,"talk_count":0,"like_count":3,"video_info":null,"quote_cards":null,"promotion_pic":null,"promotion_url":null,"promotion_id":0,"mark_desc":null,"pic_sizes":[{"width":900,"height":383}],"cover_pic_size":null,"order_id":0,"tags":[],"status_industry":null,"excellent_comments":[],"notice_tag":null,"common_emotion":null,"current_stock_price":null,"new_card":null,"source_deep_link":null,"source_feed":false,"editable":true,"like_config":null,"title_ad_pic":null,"title_ad_url":null,"title_ad_deep_link":null,"answer_comment":null,"answer_count":0,"answer_users":null,"bonus_screen_name":null,"fundx_tag":null,"extend_st_feed_info":{"stock_event_time":0,"stock_event_type":null,"change_event_color":null,"is_future_event":false,"stock_event_id":null,"stock_event_message":null,"original_text_length":869,"disputed_status":false,"excellent_status":"false"},"stock_list":[{"symbol":"SZ159735","type":"13"}],"reply_user_images":null,"reply_user_count":0,"fundx_symbol":null,"hot_new_rank":null,"image_info_list":[{"filename":"18119eefa672b413fd1a8051.jpeg","width":900,"height":383,"ocr_result":null}],"extend_st_home_page":{"ip_location":"","st_mention_stock_count":1,"ai_card":null,"ai_status":false,"speech_enable":false,"speech_info":null},"censor_state":0,"pic":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/18119eefa672b413fd1a8051.jpeg","recommend_cards":null,"vod_info":null,"forbidden_retweet":false,"is_answer":false,"is_refused":false,"text":"<p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/18119eefa672b413fd1a8051.jpeg\" /></p> <p><b>财政部 税务总局</b></p> <p><b>关于减征部分乘用车车辆购置税的公告</b></p> <p>财政部 税务总局公告2022年第20号</p> <p>　　为促进汽车消费，支持汽车产业发展，现就减征部分乘用车车辆购置税有关政策公告如下：</p> <p>　　一、对购置日期在2022年6月1日至2022年12月31日期间内且单车价格（不含增值税）不超过30万元的2.0升及以下排量乘用车，<b>减半征收车辆购置税。</b></p> <p>　　二、本公告所称乘用车，是指在设计、制造和技术特性上主要用于载运乘客及其随身行李和（或）临时物品，包括驾驶员座位在内最多不超过9个座位的汽车。</p> <p>　　三、本公告所称单车价格，以车辆购置税应税车辆的计税价格为准。</p> <p>　　四、乘用车购置日期按照机动车销售统一发票或海关关税专用缴款书等有效凭证的开具日期确定。</p> <p>　　五、乘用车排量、座位数，按照《中华人民共和国机动车整车出厂合格证》电子信息或者进口机动车《车辆电子信息单》电子信息所载的排量、额定载客（人）数确定。</p> <p>　　特此公告。</p> <p>财政部</p> <p>税务总局</p> <p>2022年5月31日</p> <p><b>附：</b><b>汽车购置税如何算？</b></p> <p><b>答：</b>汽车购置税应交税额=发票价格（含÷1.13（1+增值税率13%）*10%，现在减半征收，那么，<b>汽车购置税应交税额=发票价格÷1.13*5%。</b>车主如果购买新车选择自己上牌的，需要自己缴纳购置税，携带相关资料去上牌地办税大厅即可办理，有些地区网上也可缴纳，交完购置税后方可去车管所办理牌照！</p> <p>通过减免购置税之后，原本一辆不含税价为30万元的新车，<b>最高可</b><b>优惠购置税为1.5万元。</b></p> <p>用精炼的语言阐述深刻的财务逻辑，如文章得到您的认可，<b>希望您看完后分享到“朋友圈”或者点一下右下角的“在看”，</b>以示鼓励。长期坚持原创不易，多次想放弃，坚持是一种信仰，专注是一种态度 ，一路陪伴，一起地老天荒，谢谢。</p> <p><b>推荐阅读</b></p> <p>财务费用！！！</p> <p>报表的勾稽关系！！！</p> <p>建议大家读读《道德经》，一定会有大收获的！</p> <p>营业收入！！！</p> <p><a href=\"https://xueqiu.com/S/SZ980092?from=status_stock_match\" class=\"xq_stock\">自由现金流</a>以及现金流量表分析的要点！！！</p> <p>某些上市公司的资产负债表就是“垃圾场”！</p>","show_cover_pic":true,"legal_user_visible":false,"is_column":false,"is_ss_multi_pic":false,"is_bonus":false,"cover_pic":"","answer_question":false,"is_no_archive":false,"is_original_declare":false,"mp_not_show_status":false,"forbidden_comment":false,"is_private":false}